{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "ce0943c773ff6cad3efeb60dbe16f2347ecd33f0e1c48cc0f1b45ae7762c5a38", "ja": "アソートなアイドル達", "zh": "什锦偶像们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cca7d5e92c045dad80bbd3ed3b61c3b7b78c5e94df15d79d8a5cebfcba8cbc66", "ja": "みんなのチョコに目移りする未来と紗代子。\nそんな中、恵美チームが作っていたのは、\nよりどりみどりのアソートのチョコ。\nチョコもアイドルもよりどりみどり……\n色々な味をお楽しみに♪", "zh": "未来和纱代子看着大家的巧克力，挑花了眼。  \n在这当中，惠美队伍制作的是，  \n琳琅满目的什锦巧克力。  \n巧克力和偶像都是任君挑选……  \n敬请期待各种不同的口味♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_05_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "0fff496a7b5c8682e501a5a3730584ad4eeaf0f1e039e7859457e69215e45e89", "ja": "わあ～！　みんなの作ったチョコ、どれもすっごく\nおいしそう！　私、ぜーんぶ食べてみたいです♪", "zh": "哇～！大家做的巧克力看起来都超级好吃！我想全部都尝一遍♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_05_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "1fc2feb20f7745af41983368c0685d8fad36cbf1e262abcf7b589d736d247472", "ja": "そうだね。全部食べたくて、目移りしちゃいそう。\nチョコレートってどうしてこんなに魅力的なのかな。", "zh": "是啊。想把全部都吃一遍，感觉都要挑花眼了。\n巧克力为什么会这么有魅力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_05_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "cd675b1d12c29c1744cb5f35de24088856c8549abe16f15c6b87568f25932dbb", "ja": "そう！　ひとつになんて、決められないよね？\n甘いミルクチョコに、ビターなハイカカオチョコ……。", "zh": "对！怎么可能只选一个，对吧？\n甜甜的牛奶巧克力，还有苦香的高可可巧克力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_05_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "0ad9ce72306032b75eac27709fb2cd07723b859941627fcbe59652ed531098cc", "ja": "全部食べたいし、アレンジも必要でしょ？　だから\nアタシたちが作るのは、アソートのチョコ！", "zh": "我全都想吃，当然也需要花点心思搭配吧？所以\n我们要做的是巧克力什锦礼盒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_05_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "16b934d252764fd27e56e0474b4c9e79041f727fd41b91b3a22a437175a6d494", "ja": "えーっ！？　恵美ちゃん、\nそれってちょっとズルくないかな……？", "zh": "诶——！？惠美，这样是不是有点耍赖了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_05_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "577aad5604edccc284c03db83f996c840bba515ae92fcd7a0a6d1cc213d02e0e", "ja": "私は、恵美ちゃんに賛成でーす！\nたくさん種類があったほうが、絶対楽しいもん♪", "zh": "我赞成惠美哦！\n种类多一些，绝对会更开心嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_05_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "dd10a460a325958a0b90b1d944cc679fa95fc0c3b382146510c7564bb6e46195", "ja": "おっ。未来、いいコト言うね！　チョコもアイドルも、\nいろんな子がいたほうが楽しいって♪", "zh": "哦，未来，说得好！巧克力也好，偶像也好，种类丰富一些才更开心嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_05_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "df8f551187faff73bc177fb25e72a2850b2a344e79bf46fc13ab22e2a5505f79", "ja": "愛情たーっぷりこめて作るから、みんなに\n受け取ってほしいな～。にゃはは♪", "zh": "我会倾注满满的爱来制作，所以希望大家都能收下～。呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
